1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,050
Excuse me.

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:01,650
Yes?

3
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:06,920
I wonder if you could spare a few minutes to do a survey on transport. It won't take long.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,670
No, that's fine.

5
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,558
Lovely. The survey is on behalf of the local council.

6
00:00:12,558 --> 00:00:15,840
They'd like to know about what transport you use

7
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,000
and any suggestions for improvement.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,920
Can I start by asking you how you travelled to town today?

9
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,150
Sure. I came on the bus.

10
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,970
Great. Now can I get a few details about yourself?

11
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:28,560
OK.

12
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,940
What's your name?

13
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,360
It's Luisa....

14
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,160
Yes.

15
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:32,660
Hardie.

16
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,200
Can you spell that, please?

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,890
Yes, it's H-A-R-D-I-E.

18
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:42,320
Great. Thanks. And can I have your address?

19
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:45,240
It's 19, White Stone Road.

20
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:48,860
Oh, right. I know that area. It's Bradfield, isn't it?

21
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:50,110
That's right.

22
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:52,320
Is the postcode GT7?

23
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,480
It's actually G-T-8 2-L-C.

24
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:59,470
Great. And could I ask what your job is? Are you a student?

25
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:02,850
I've actually just finished my training. I'm a hairdresser.

26
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:06,260
Oh, right. And one more question in this section

27
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:09,400
What is the reason for you coming into town today?

28
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:13,440
Actually it's not for shopping today, which would be my normal reason

29
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,140
but to see the dentist.

30
00:01:15,140 --> 00:01:18,070
Right. Thanks.

31
00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:23,976
Now in this last section I'd like you to give us some ideas about the facilities

32
00:01:23,976 --> 00:01:26,660
and arrangements in the city for getting to

33
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:30,620
and from work, er, any suggestions you have for improvements.

34
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:35,140
Well, something I've thought about for some time is that

35
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,813
when I do walk and I'm doing a later shift,

36
00:01:37,813 --> 00:01:40,330
I think the lighting should be better.

37
00:01:40,330 --> 00:01:41,630
Yes, good point.

38
00:01:41,630 --> 00:01:46,341
And of course, I think it's a real shame they've been cutting down on the number of footpaths.

39
00:01:46,341 --> 00:01:49,220
They should have more of those. Then people would walk more.

40
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:50,170
Yes, right.

41
00:01:50,170 --> 00:01:53,300
And, I don't think there are enough trains

42
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:55,650
That's why I don't use them - you have to wait so long.

43
00:01:55,650 --> 00:01:59,041
Thanks. And finally I'd like to ask your opinion on cycling.

44
00:01:59,041 --> 00:02:04,590
As you may know, there's a drive in the city to get more people to cycle to work.

45
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:05,150
Right.

46
00:02:05,150 --> 00:02:08,241
But we realize that there are things which the council,

47
00:02:08,241 --> 00:02:12,260
but also employers, might do to help encourage workers to cycle to work.

48
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:15,820
Yep. Well, I have thought about it and

49
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:18,750
where I work there are no safe places to leave your bikes.

50
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:19,770
OK.

51
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:21,748
And also, I'd have to cycle uphill

52
00:02:21,748 --> 00:02:25,140
and on a hot day I'd arrive at work pretty sweaty

53
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,680
so I think I'd need a shower somewhere at work.

54
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,290
Right.

55
00:02:28,290 --> 00:02:34,780
And I suppose the last thing is that I wouldn't be all that confident about cycling on such busy roads.

56
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:37,724
I think I'd like to see you offering training for that,

57
00:02:37,724 --> 00:02:41,470
you know, I'd feel a lot better about starting if that was the case.

58
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:45,220
Well, that's very helpful. Thank you very much for your time.

59
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:46,800
No problem, bye!
